    "\n",
    "## 🎯 Learning Objectives\n",
    "\n",
    "By the end of this notebook, you will:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Understand** agent components through a relatable analogy\n",
    "2. **Map** junior dev concepts to agent concepts\n",
    "3. **Apply** this mental model to build better agents\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## ⏱️ Time Estimate\n",
    "\n",
    "**~20 minutes**\n",
    "\n",
